<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-082-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.416368" lon="-120.930635"><name>SC26-082-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 67/100; not catch probability. Center 88 ft; nearby 85–107 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-062</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.41906261469126" lon="-120.93271340903915"/><trkpt lat="35.41844692664196" lon="-120.93361015974352"/><trkpt lat="35.41773547137296" lon="-120.9341789636707"/><trkpt lat="35.416479589884595" lon="-120.93454140716281"/><trkpt lat="35.41566672151963" lon="-120.93445203703536"/><trkpt lat="35.41566295463376" lon="-120.93423188669114"/><trkpt lat="35.41529686585445" lon="-120.93391086617216"/><trkpt lat="35.41527990742454" lon="-120.9329201948106"/><trkpt lat="35.41491381538739" lon="-120.93259918183927"/><trkpt lat="35.414816165263915" lon="-120.9321611889248"/><trkpt lat="35.41427173831754" lon="-120.93195486119846"/><trkpt lat="35.413971228914555" lon="-120.93020060845201"/><trkpt lat="35.413338577079685" lon="-120.93010667307622"/><trkpt lat="35.41349803020082" lon="-120.92889127157304"/><trkpt lat="35.413860355148906" lon="-120.92899211725157"/><trkpt lat="35.41385091271761" lon="-120.92844175565055"/><trkpt lat="35.41403113098987" lon="-120.92843714127903"/><trkpt lat="35.41402357519072"